  "id": "openalex:W1993550580",
  "title": "Spiral magnetic ordering in bismuth ferrite",
  "abstract": "New information on the magnetic ordering of the iron ions in bismuth ferrite BiFeO 3 was obtained by a study with a high-resolution time-of-flight neutron diffractometer. The observed splitting of magnetic diffraction maxima could be interpreted in terms of a magnetic cycloidal spiral with a long period of 620+or-20 AA, which is unusual for perovskites.",
